sequenceDiagram
 participant P as Payment Pipeline
 participant A as Network Adapter
 participant E as Engine
 participant S as Snapshot
 participant D as Decision Store
 P->>A: raw authorization/clearing
 A->>E: normalized transaction
 E->>S: get(event date, network, region)
 S-->>E: immutable compiled partition
 E-->>P: decision + explanation
 E-->>D: persist decision
